msgid ""
"Closing and reopening Actioneer is more reliable, so you are less likely to "
"see an unexpected crash report after a normal shutdown."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:99
msgid ""
"Sign-in checks and secure storage now recover more gracefully when desktop "
"services are slow to respond."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:100
msgid "Updated bundled components help keep the app reliable and up to date."
msgstr ""

