msgid ""
"Older workflow runs now show dates in your selected app language, making run "
"history easier to scan."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:108
msgid ""
"Updated components and build improvements help keep Linux releases more "
"reliable."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:115
msgid ""
"Refreshed the GNOME desktop libraries and HTTP stack for a more reliable, up-"
"to-date experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:122
msgid ""
"Refreshed bundled components for a more reliable and up-to-date experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:129
msgid ""
"This release includes an important security update to help keep Actioneer "
"safer to use."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:130
msgid ""
"Bundled components have been refreshed for a more reliable and up-to-date "
"experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:137
msgid ""
"Workflow runs and expanded details are now more stable during background "
"refreshes, with badges and job summaries preserved while results update."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:138
msgid ""
"Completed runs now stay collapsed when you close them, and run detail "
"actions recover more reliably after temporary loading hiccups."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:139
msgid ""
"GitHub connectivity is more resilient to API and permission-related "
"responses, helping keep repository and workflow data visible instead of "
"unexpectedly signing you out."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:146
msgid ""
"In-progress workflow runs now stay up to date, so jobs and steps refresh "
"while a run is still active."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:147
msgid ""
"Expanded run details are more stable and easier to follow, with clearer job "
"badges and step numbering."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:148
msgid ""
"Workflow status badges are now translated more consistently across the app."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:149
msgid ""
"Background refresh is lighter on the GitHub API, which helps preserve your "
"rate limit."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:156
msgid ""
"The app now feels faster and smoother during sign-in, refreshes, and "
"everyday navigation."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:157
msgid ""
"Notifications and background updates are more reliable, so important run "
"results are less likely to be missed."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:158
msgid ""
"German and Dutch translations are now available across the app and listing "
"metadata."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:165
msgid ""
"Actioneer is now localized in English, German, Dutch, Simplified Chinese, "
"Hindi, Spanish, French, Arabic, Bengali, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, and "
"Urdu."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:166
msgid ""
"Added Help and Shortcuts to make in-app guidance and keyboard workflows "
"easier."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:167
msgid "Improved GitHub request stability with client-side timeouts."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:174
msgid ""
"Manual workflow triggers now support workflow_dispatch inputs with dynamic "
"parameter fields."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:175
msgid "Dependency updates for ryu, unicode-ident, and zmij."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:182
msgid ""
"Handle expired job logs (HTTP 410) with clearer messaging instead of a "
"broken view."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:183
msgid ""
"Strip BOM markers in job logs so first-line timestamps render correctly."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:190
msgid ""
"Job logs now render ANSI colors, grouped workflow sections, and clearer "
"command/output formatting."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:191
msgid ""
"Aligned timestamps and command prefixes improve scanability, with stronger "
"error highlighting."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo.xml.in:192
msgid ""
"Packaging CI refreshed with multi-arch updates for AppImage/Snap/Flatpak "
"builds."
msgstr ""

